            <ArticleTitle>Myelography with the non-ionic water-soluble contrast medium metrizamide.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>417-35</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Technical problems in myelography with the water-soluble contrast medium, metrizamide are analysed and a technique used for examination of the entire spinal subarachnoid space is described. The choice of gas or water-soluble contrast medium for myelography is also discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
